  "input_contract": {
    "entry": "Current map7/0 object0 selection supplies script08180141; natural map/object interaction reachability is a separate obligation.",
    "prefix": "固定script byte列のgrammarと有限edgeだけを検査する。Python source転送例は現ROM handlerの実行証明ではなく、contextを進めない。root_verifiedは現登録とscript構造だけを意味する。",
    "special": "固定source転送意味ではRESULT8/0が左右pathを選ぶ、という別々の条件例だけを確認する。現ROM special344/waitstateの効果、結果の生成、自然到達は証明しない。",
    "handoff": "実suffixの入口条件は、現登録script中の構造上validな選択command contextが得られていること。検証では実InitScriptContextとSetupScriptへ選択PCを渡し、その条件を具体化する。登録rootからruntimeで到達したとは扱わず、text pointerはseedしない。",
    "consumer": "Actual dispatcher, LOADWORD operand reader/data0 store, CALLSTD4 stack push/pointer store, message(NULL), ShowFieldMessage and StringExpandPlaceholders execute with message state0. Stop immediately after complete EOS expansion, before rendering helpers.",
    "memory": "Context, stack, expanded-text output and message-state storage are aligned, disjoint and live for each finite invocation. No allocation, free, IRQ or arbitrary external call occurs inside the selected producer/consumer prefix. Universal lifetime and asynchronous effects are outside scope.",
    "minimum": "Only the 4-byte hit0818034F is classified. Root/script/consumer code, literal/table cells and both complete texts are evidence only; no other region is excluded."
  },
